BEGIN ARCHIVED CONTENT
Table: Mean MIC per feature across the 21 early dataset--epoch combinations.

Estimator: pure-Python equipartition/grid MIC approximation; grid products are limited by B(n)=max(4, floor(n**0.6)); permutation p-values use 200 shuffles.

| Rank | Feature | Mean MIC | Mean abs Spearman rho | Sig. Tests |
|---:|:---|---:|---:|---:|
| 1 | Sensitivity | 0.231 | 0.443 | 18/21 |
| 2 | Effective rank | 0.170 | 0.313 | 12/21 |
| 3 | Taylor importance | 0.138 | 0.306 | 7/21 |
| 4 | WeightWatcher | 0.138 | 0.267 | 8/21 |
| 5 | Activation statistics | 0.118 | 0.127 | 10/21 |
| 6 | Gradient flow | 0.112 | 0.249 | 14/21 |
| 7 | CKA similarity | 0.109 | 0.239 | 13/21 |

END ARCHIVED CONTENT

